    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Salty Pomegranate And Peppers Salad\"\n  servings: 5\n  prep_time: \"24 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"67 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 lbs fish stock\"\n    \"4 oz spelt bread\"\n    \"2 lbs quinoa\"\n    \"4 lbs jelly\"\n    \"2 tbsp spelt bread\"\n    \"1 lbs buckwheat\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A slow-roasted Roseate Spoonbill with a crunchy, delicious exterior. Stuffed with blackberry and covered in strawberry sauce. Sides with pumpkin puree and wild swiss chard.\"\n    \"Crispy fried pork bites, seasoned with galangal and served with a tangy kiwiberry dipping sauce.\"\n    \"Fresh coffee with a pinch of ajwain seed, topped by a caramelized banana with whipped cream\"\n    \"Grilled lamb kebabs, marinated in Pakistani spices and served with a fresh kohlrabi and custard apples daikon salad.\"\n    \"Hearty cornmeal and beef stew, slow-cooked with dill and dried chinese broccoli for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 728\n    protein: \"47g\"\n    carbs: \"100g\"\n    fat: \"9g\"\n  }\n}"
