  {
    num: "17461"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Tempeh Stir Fry\"\n  servings: 8\n  prep_time: \"20 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"59 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 oz milk chocolate\"\n    \"3 tbsp celery\"\n    \"2 tbsp turkey\"\n    \"1 cups coconut water\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious lamb and delicious bush tomato, baked in a fluffy pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"Crispy fried duck bites, seasoned with sumac and served with a tangy kiwiberry dipping sauce.\"\n    \"Three blue swimmer crab with radish, arugula, snowpea sprouts, red cabbage and incaberries. With a side of baked custard apple, and your choice of brussels sprouts or tea oil.\"\n    \"An exquisite lamb roast, infused with the essence of snowpea, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy pumpkin\"\n    \"A succulent duck steak, encased in a crispy chives crust, served with a side of cloves mashed okra.\"\n    \"A fluffy hijiki creation, seasoned with vanilla and chamomile, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 782\n    protein: \"28g\"\n    carbs: \"94g\"\n    fat: \"19g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
