  {
    num: "17463"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Horseradish-infused Venison\"\n  servings: 4\n  prep_time: \"28 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"104 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 cups capsicum\"\n    \"4 oz flathead\"\n    \"4 tsp squid\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A simple guava pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of juicy rhubarb, complemented by starfruit and oregano.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of creamy rhubarb, complemented by cavalo and rice paper.\"\n    \"A golden cornichons creation, seasoned with bay leaves and pot marjoram, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Juicy venison, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold german chamomile sauce, served alongside roasted rhubarb.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of juicy zucchini, complemented by mangosteen and celery.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining tender bean sprouts and sweet papaw, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of chervil.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 687\n    protein: \"7g\"\n    carbs: \"20g\"\n    fat: \"25g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
