  {
    num: "17480"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Squash And Mackerel Stew\"\n  servings: 5\n  prep_time: \"35 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"108 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 oz broccoli\"\n    \"3 pieces carrot\"\n    \"1 tbsp fresh chillies\"\n    \"4 tsp sugar\"\n    \"1 lbs rice noodles\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Our fresh emu, slow-cooked to perfection, accompanied by steamed jicama and a rich, savory gravy.\"\n    \"A special red wattleseed from Curaçao. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of ajwan seed.\"\n    \"Juicy pork, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold vanilla sauce, served alongside roasted chilli pepper.\"\n    \"Tenderly braised ostrich in a rich liquorice root and peppers sauce, served with a side of creamy beans.\"\n    \"A moist rhubarb creation, seasoned with curry and balti masala, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Baked tahini-stuffed quail, seasoned with dhansak and spicy herbs, accompanied by roasted artichoke medley.\"\n    \"Tender ostrich skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy tangelo sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 695\n    protein: \"37g\"\n    carbs: \"12g\"\n    fat: \"31g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
